error[X0822]: a field can't hold a scoped `Res`
  --> scoped.xn:2:20
   |
 2 |   private var held:Res                                  // X0822: field
   |                    ^^^ a field outlives any scope
...
54 |   public function ~Res() {}
   |                    --- this destructor makes `Res` scoped
   |
   = note: scoped values are destroyed when the scope owning them ends, so they can't be kept in fields
help: to keep `Res` values beyond a scope, give it no destructor and implement `IDisposable` instead: its own `dispose()`, called by `using` or by hand

